WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.400
My name is Xavia Grey.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.720
I'm head of the Siren Corporation.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.020
Founder of the Thea Project.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.280
Thea is the only planet we've discovered thus far that can sustain human life.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.420
We at Siren are currently in the process of its colonization.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.660
This is a new world.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:30.100
Where your history no longer has any relevance.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.820
You have the opportunity to become

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.440
whatever you want to be.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.280
 

00:00:40.285 --> 00:00:41.285
 

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.040
 

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.280
Everyone's looking for you.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.620
You have to disappear.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:55.500
People are up there living new lives

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.560
leaving everything else behind.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.700
Hello?

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.500
Hello?

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.580
What the hell happened on the ship?

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:39.240
The crew... the other passengers....

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:42.760
They left without us.

